    "zh": "小更新：Lightroom 启动后第一张美颜预览恢复到约 0.1.5 的速度（显卡）；设置里“自动检查更新”下的说明已译成全部 20 种语言；更新提示里的大小按各语言的小数点书写。修图结果与 0.1.7 相同。",
    "en": "Small update: in Lightroom the first retouch preview after starting is back to about the speed of 0.1.5 on NVIDIA cards; the note under \"Check for updates automatically\" is translated into all 20 languages; sizes in update messages use each language's decimal mark. Results are the same as in 0.1.7."
